# Install support for <adhoc any> steps.

# Client-side support: allow a <route> to take <adhoc any> steps,
# by simply relaying the step on to the remote peer and wrapping
# the reply appropriately.
? <q <resolve-path-step ?origin <adhoc ?label>>> [
  $origin <resolve <adhoc $label> <* $config [
    <rewrite ?reply <a <resolve-path-step $origin <adhoc $label>> $reply>>]>>
]

# Explicit server-side support is not required: a <bind <adhoc LABEL> REF #f>
# to the gatekeeper's bindspace suffices.
[]
